on wholesale prices.^Fluctuations in the WPI can influence agriculture market dynamics, affecting demand and supply and also farming decisions such as crop choices and investment in agricultural inputs.^WPI might influence retail markets, economic policies, including agricultural subsidies, export-import policies, and monetary policy.^International price trends and trade policies impact the WPI for food articles."},{"question":"How to interpret the Wholesale Price Index - Food Articles data?","answer":"$2a"}],"related":[{"slug":"annual-rainfall-lpa","title":"Annual Rainfall (% of LPA)"},{"slug":"consumer-price-index-cpi-inflation-food","title":"Consumer Price Index (CPI) Inflation - Food"},{"slug":"consumer-price-index-cpi-inflation-food-rural","title":"Consumer Price Index (CPI) Inflation - Food Rural"},{"slug":"consumer-price-index-cpi-inflation-miscellaneous-rural","title":"Consumer Price Index (CPI) Inflation- Miscellaneous Rural"},{"slug":"domestic-tractor-sales","title":"Domestic Tractor Sales"},{"slug":"exports-agricultural-allied-products","title":"Exports - Agricultural & Allied Products"},{"slug":"fertiliser-sales","title":"Fertiliser Sales"},{"slug":"foodgrain-stocks","title":"Foodgrain Stocks"},{"slug":"kharif-sowing-progress","title":"Kharif Sowing Progress"},{"slug":"rabi-sowing-progress","title":"Rabi Sowing Progress"},{"slug":"reservoir-level-10-year-average","title":"Reservoir Level (vs 10Y Avg)"},{"slug":"south-west-monsoon-rainfall-deviation-from-normal","title":"South-west Monsoon Rainfall: Deviation from Normal"}],"title":"Wholesale Price Index (WPI) Inflation - Food","description":"Food articles WPI inflation stands at 8.14% for Sep 2026. Comparing this against food CPI shows whether pressure starts at the farm gate or builds later.","headline":{"Absolute":"Food articles WPI inflation stands at 122.2 for Sep 2026. Comparing this against food CPI shows whether pressure starts at the farm gate or builds later.","Y-o-Y":"Food articles WPI inflatio